   "text_1": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "text": "<h3><b>LI5070SA’s 4K 10 MP global shutter sensor is designed for high-end security and cinema cameras.</b></h3>\r\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<p>The Canon LI5070SA CMOS Sensor, available in RGB, offers 10M pixels in a Super35 format. It’s global shutter, square 6.4μm x 6.4μm pixel arrangement and professional-grade imaging delivers performance suitable for high-end security and cinema cameras.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
    "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
    "textIsRich": "true"
   }
  },
