  "title_wrap": {
   "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
   "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
   "title": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:title": "Canon LI7050SA 2M CMOS Sensor ",
    "type": "h1",
    "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
   }
  },
  "text_intro_wrap": {
   "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
   "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
   "text_intro": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "text": "<p>The Canon LI7050SA CMOS Sensor offers 2M pixel HDR with high sensitivity at an affordable price. It’s square 4.1μm x 4.1μm pixel arrangement and 1/1.8″ frame achieves very high and low light capability in a compact design. Discover how you can take your surveillance project to new heights with the LI7050SA from Canon.</p>",
    "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
    "textIsRich": "true"
   }
  },
  "carousel_1_wrap": {
   "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
   "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
   "carousel_1": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/carousel",
    "image_1": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "fileReference": "/content/dam/macnicagwi/americas/mai/public/en/images/products/canon-LI7050SA.jpg",
     "alt": "Canon LI7050SA Side",
     "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/image"
    }
   }
  },
  "text_1_wrap": {
   "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
   "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
   "text_1": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "text": "<h3><b>Take Your High-End Surveillance Project To New Heights with the LI7050SA</b></h3>\r\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<p>The Canon LI7050SA CMOS Sensor offers 2M pixel HDR with high sensitivity at an affordable price. It’s square 4.1μm x 4.1μm pixel arrangement and 1/1.8″ frame achieves very high and low light capability in a compact design. Discover how you can take your surveillance project to new heights with the LI7050SA from Canon.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
    "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
    "textIsRich": "true"
   }
  },
  "text_2_wrap": {
   "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
   "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
   "text_2": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "text": "<h3><b>A Top-of-the-Line CMOS Sensor</b></h3>\r\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<p>With rolling shutter and a sensor size of 7.9 x 4.5 mm, the Canon LI7050SA is a top-of-the-line CMOS Sensor. It offers a dynamic range of 120 dB and a maximum frame rate of 60 fps, creating flexibility and performance. It is available with an RGB filter type and has a sensitivity of 54,000 e/lx/sec, making it ideal for a number of applications.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
    "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
    "textIsRich": "true"
   }
  },
  "heading_1_wrap": {
   "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
   "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
   "heading_1": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:title": "Technical Specifications",
    "type": "h2",
    "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
   }
  },
  "table_1_wrap": {
   "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
   "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
   "table_1": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "text": "<table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody><tr><th>Resolution</th>\r\n<td>2.12 MP</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Pixel count</th>\r\n<td>1,936 x 1,096</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Pixel pitch</th>\r\n<td>4.1 μm</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Sensor Size</th>\r\n<td>7.9 x 4.5 mm</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Shutter Type</th>\r\n<td>Rolling</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Dark Random Noise</th>\r\n<td>1.1 e-rms @room temperature</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Frame rate</th>\r\n<td>60 fps, 30fps (HDR)</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Color filter options</th>\r\n<td>RGB</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Sensitivity</th>\r\n<td>54,000 [e/lx/sec] (Green)</td>\r\n</tr></tbody></table>\r\n",
    "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/table",
    "textIsRich": "true"
   }
  },
  "image_1_wrap": {
   "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
