  },
  "text_1_wrap": {
   "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
   "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
   "text_1": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "text": "<h3><b>Canon LI7080SA CMOS Sensor</b></h3>\r\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\r\n<p>Utilizing high-speed signal readout technology, the super 35mm format Canon LI7080SA CMOS sensor boasts 4.5K resolution at 120 frames per second. With a 6.4 μm x 6.4 μm pixel size and rolling shutter technology, the LI7080SA provides professional-grade imaging that delivers performance suitable for high-end security and cinema cameras.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
    "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
    "textIsRich": "true"
   }
  },
  "heading_1_wrap": {
   "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
   "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
   "heading_1": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:title": "Technical Specifications",
    "type": "h2",
    "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
   }
  },
  "table_1_wrap": {
   "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
   "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
   "table_1": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "text": "<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody><tr><th>Filter Type</th>\r\n<td>RGB (RGB on-chip color filter)</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Recording screen size:</th>\r\n<td>Greater than Super 35mm (29.0 mm x 15.4 mm)</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Number of effective pixels:</th>\r\n<td>4536 x 2400 (Horizontal x Vertical)</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Pixel size:</th>\r\n<td>6.4 μm x 6.4 μm</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Number of output channels:</th>\r\n<td>Data 30 lanes, Clock 2 lanes</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Output format:</th>\r\n<td>LVDS output, 840 Mbps @14bit</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Main clock frequency:</th>\r\n<td>60 MHz (recommended)</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>All pixel readout:</th>\r\n<td>120 fps</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Analog gain:</th>\r\n<td>-6dB, 0dB, 6dB, 12dB, 18dB and 24dB</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Saturation:</th>\r\n<td>82,000 e (Typ.) @120fps</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Sensitivity:</th>\r\n<td>85,000 e/lx/sec (Typ.)</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Dark Random Noise:</th>\r\n<td>2.2 e-rms @18dB</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Dark Current:</th>\r\n<td>33 e/sec (Typ.) @60°C (package reverse side), 18dB</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Power consumption:</th>\r\n<td>2.3 W (Typ.) @120fps</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Power supply voltage:</th>\r\n<td>3.5V, 3.3 V, 1.8V, -1.2V, 2.62V, 2.5V, 1.6V</td>\r\n</tr></tbody></table>\r\n",
    "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/table",
    "textIsRich": "true"
   }
  },
